    "preamble": "Sri Konduri Sridhar vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 28 July, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition Nos. 2108, 2111, 2115, 2116, 2248, 2252, 2272, 2361, 2850 and 2870 Of 2020 Common Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "3. When the matters are taken up for hearing, both the learned counsel for the petitioners in all these petitions and the learned Additional Public Prosecutor would submit that these matters are squarely covered by earlier decisions of this court, whereunder criminal proceedings initiated against the petitioners therein based on similar set of facts are [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this court, as not maintainable.",
